#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:8
msgid "只消费 CPU Runtime"
msgstr "Consume only the CPU Runtime"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:10
msgid ""
"仅复用 Core、Arch、公开 I/O 和所选 OS 时，选择 `Nexus::Runtime`。调用者自己提供 "
"启动、向量、链接布局、时钟、Board 和具体驱动；此入口不创建 SoC factory。 完整 SoC／Board 工程继续使用 "
"`nexus_add_platform`，两者在一个构建目录中互斥。"
msgstr ""
"Select `Nexus::Runtime` to reuse only Core, Arch, public I/O and the "
"selected OS. The caller supplies startup, vectors, link layout, clocks, "
"Board and concrete drivers. This entry creates no SoC factory. Complete "
"SoC/Board projects continue to use `nexus_add_platform`; the two are "
"mutually exclusive within a build directory."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:14
msgid "提供运行时事实"
msgstr "Provide runtime facts"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:16
msgid ""
"应用维护 `runtime.toml` 与 CPU 包的 `cpu.json`。最小 runtime 输入如下，路径相对 该 TOML；对应供应方须已按"
" SDK profile 准备："
msgstr ""
"The application maintains `runtime.toml` and the CPU package's `cpu.json`. "
"The following is minimal runtime input; paths are relative to that TOML. The"
" relevant suppliers must already be prepared through the SDK profile:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:26
msgid "下面是 M33 NonSecure 软件配置示意；IRQ、时钟和可选能力须替换为实际审核事实， 示意不会增加新的芯片或 Board 支持："
msgstr ""
"The following illustrates an M33 NonSecure software configuration. Replace "
"IRQ, clock and optional capabilities with reviewed actual facts. This "
"example does not add chip or Board support:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:43
msgid ""
"后端为 baremetal、FreeRTOS 或已维护范围内的 ThreadX；裸机不接纳内核策略， CPU-only 输入也不接纳需要 SoC "
"timer 事实的低功耗选择。`clock_hz` 描述频率， 不执行时钟配置。未知字段、矛盾特征／ABI 和非法路径必须拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Backends are baremetal, FreeRTOS or ThreadX within maintained scope. "
"Baremetal accepts no kernel policy; CPU-only inputs also reject low-power "
"selections requiring SoC timer facts. `clock_hz` describes frequency; it "
"does not configure a clock. Unknown fields, conflicting features/ABI and "
"invalid paths must be rejected."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:47
msgid "显式创建 Runtime"
msgstr "Create Runtime explicitly"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:49
msgid "以下是库消费片段，尚不构成可上板固件："
msgstr ""
"The following is a library-consumption fragment, not yet a flashable "
"firmware:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:60
msgid ""
"MCU 自建 executable 还需调用 `nexus_apply_firmware_policy(target)`，并显式提供 "
"自己的启动与链接脚本。仅连接 Runtime 不自动选择运行库或 `-nostartfiles`。 工具链仍须在 `project()` 前选定。"
msgstr ""
"A caller-created MCU executable must also call "
"`nexus_apply_firmware_policy(target)` and explicitly supply its own startup "
"and linker script. Linking Runtime alone does not automatically select "
"runtime libraries or `-nostartfiles`. The toolchain must still be selected "
"before `project()`."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:64
msgid "单独生成时可运行："
msgstr "For separate generation, run:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cpu-runtime.md:70
msgid ""
"输出 CPU resolved、配置头与选择信息，不输出设备 bindings／factory／链接脚本。完整字段和后端范围见 [Arch "
"参考](../reference/platforms/cortex-m.md)与[OS "
"合同](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The output contains CPU resolved data, a configuration header and selection "
"information, but no device bindings, factory or linker script. See the [Arch"
" reference](../reference/platforms/cortex-m.md) and [OS "
"contract](../reference/contracts/os/execution.md) for complete fields and "
"backend scope."
